    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "37 Mount Bellew Crescent presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-proportioned three-bedroom home in one of Lucan's most established and sought-after residential developments.\r\n\r\nSituated in a particularly private position within Mount Bellew, the property enjoys a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of an excellent range of schools, shops, recreational facilities, public transport and major road networks.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out over three floors. On entering the property, the welcoming hallway leads through to a bright and comfortable living room, while the kitchen provides a practical and well-proportioned space for everyday family living and dining. A guest WC completes the ground-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe first floor provides two well-proportioned bedrooms, with fitted ward ropes together with the main family bathroom. The principal bedroom benefits from the added convenience of a private ensuite, providing excellent flexibility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe second floor provides a generous third bedroom, offering an ideal space for a teenager, home office, guest bedroom or additional family accommodation.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is a private, enclosed gravel garden, offering a low-maintenance outdoor space with an excellent degree of privacy. The secluded nature of the rear garden is a particularly attractive feature of the property and provides a pleasant setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway\r\nGuest WC\r\nLiving room\r\nKitchen\r\nThree bedrooms\r\nMain family bathroom\r\nEnsuite to principal bedroom\r\nPrivate enclosed gravel rear garden\r\nCommunal/resident parking to the front"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Mount Bellew is a mature and highly regarded residential development situated in St Mary's Parish, Lucan, enjoying a particularly convenient location just off the N4.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally positioned for families, with a number of primary and secondary schools within easy reach. Lucan Educate Together National School is located approximately 100 metres from the development, while other schools in the wider Lucan area include Gaelscoil Naomh Pádraig, Esker Educate Together, Coláiste Phádraig CBS and St Kevin's Community College.\r\n\r\nThere is an excellent selection of recreational facilities nearby, including Willsbrook Park, while Lucan Village provides a wide range of cafés, restaurants, pubs, shops and everyday services. The property is also within easy reach of Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, providing an extensive choice of retail, dining and leisure facilities.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the location is particularly convenient, with easy access to the N4, M50 and wider national road network. Public transport services provide access towards Dublin city centre and surrounding areas, making Mount Bellew a popular choice for both families and commuters."
      }
    ],
